<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"The skin...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I stopped the glass of tomato juice I had been about to drink from.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body? The whole body at that?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right. Not a figure of speech of any kind. Literally, the skin was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> off and the victim lay dying. That is what I think."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey now... 'bad' doesn't cover that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face twitched.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Something this ghastly was beyond what she had expected, I suppose.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I examined the other lines too, death by burning and dissolution by acid, but in the end I think this possibility is the strongest. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It is a way of killing cruel enough to stand alongside the past Megasawa City murders. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">After all, it means the skin of the whole body was gouged away with a blade while the victim was alive and conscious."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Whoa... I have heard of dismembered bodies and terrible lynching cases, but the skin flayed off a whole body..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"And as if to back that up, the witnesses said this with one voice."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
